{title: Sach Keh Raha Hai Deewana}
{artist: Rhtdm K K}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]Such kehraha hai dewana        [Am]Dil..dil naa kisi se lagana
[Am]Jhoothe hai yaar ke wade saare        [Am]Jhoothi hai pyarr ki kasme

{c: Verse 1}
Maine[G]har lamha jise chaha jise puja        [F]Ushi ne yaaro mera dil
[E]Tora tora...tanha tanha choda

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Mausam mausam[G]tha suhana bada        [Am]Mausam mausam[G]maine dekha usse
[D]Hua mai pagal[Bm]bas pal bhar[G]me        [Am]Aake basi hai woh[G]mere mann me
[F]Uski kami hai ab[E]jeevan mein        [Am]Woh door hai meri[G]naazron se
[F]Kyun usse mein[E]chahu

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Sunder sunder[G]woh hasina badi        [C]Sunder sunder[G]mein to khone laga
[D]Uske nashe me[Bm]bin piyeh[G]behka        [Am]Ek din usse bhula[G]dunga mein
[F]Uski nisha mitta[E]dunga mein        [Am]Chahunga naa mai uss[G]pathar ko
[F]Jaa usse bata[E]de

